The registry-first sample tests/registry/sg.jsonl contains postal codes, block numbers, road
names and coordinates from OneMap, the national map of Singapore by the Singapore Land Authority
(SLA), retrieved through the OneMap Search API (https://www.onemap.gov.sg/apidocs/search).
Contains information from OneMap Search API accessed in October 2026 from the Singapore Land
Authority (https://www.onemap.gov.sg/) which is made available under the terms of the Singapore
Open Data Licence version 1.0 (https://www.onemap.gov.sg/legal/opendatalicence.html). Its use
does not suggest any official status or endorsement by the SLA.
Queries were constructed from the block number, road name and postal code of each result;
coordinates are the API's WGS84 latitude/longitude, unchanged. The retrieval date and a SHA-256
of the sampled responses are recorded in each case and in docs/evaluation/registry/sg.md.
